", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=acMbowHk-JEQ7kNvwFDRpl7&_nc_oc=Adp1Q5jy75fW6Hy1GEzgwAab_xEzyBncArEuofNOkuXc68-un7Sckzmaj_bP9e2uyZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6rw2UUjDWx5hUOdHl-xC2p-GoJGcih5ArxELsDf-el_Q&oe=6A0F0AF9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7c_cp6CHlaIQ7kNvwF-of_O&_nc_oc=Adrk5pkYMeaBK5XmMv0k4lVm0raOBLio46mny0fN-GCOULLO6ElkGVb95x47lQ6-BSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4yCmFDtfDypqmG0qh_4kJOvqVLSOl7ywB3k2Q6v01Y0g&oe=6A0F21CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8XfhyUH6hJAQ7kNvwF-Swui&_nc_oc=AdrYnTmnLcxUS0yhI88Ra3aMW5UlVOuyjTxpniqo0_za-klMB8NHdK9hH1hTjN_V7FE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Xi4Ux-hzGR86qq7BfuoL1_SnCfHL-o0DD2vP8GUEuJA&oe=6A0F204E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel